  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Persisted → Delivered",
      "items": [
        "消息必须先 Persisted 成功，才能进入 delivery；是「已持久化」和「已送达」两阶段 UI 状态（单勾 vs 双勾第一勾）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Presence Branch",
      "items": [
        "Routed 阶段读取 DsFreeRing uid 集合；命中 → Online Match→Ws Push；不命中 → Offline Fallback→系统推送，两种路径最终都会到 Delivered 状态"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Read Receipt is Terminal",
      "items": [
        "Done Double Check = Delivered + Read 双事件都已发出；聊天 UI 才显示真正的双勾已读"
      ]
    }
